WEBVTT

00:10:28.648 --> 00:10:30.976
that that was one more
than he had in his head

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:32.157
at various times.

00:10:32.181 --> 00:10:33.929
(Laughter)

00:10:33.953 --> 00:10:35.999
But he wrote something
where I think he did

00:10:36.023 --> 00:10:37.739
what I tried to do in this pyramid.

00:10:37.763 --> 00:10:40.166
He called it "The Road
Ahead, or the Road Behind."

00:10:40.190 --> 00:10:43.976
He said, "Sometimes I think the Fates
must grin as we denounce them and insist

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:48.189
the only reason we can't win,
is the Fates themselves have missed.

00:10:48.213 --> 00:10:49.976
Yet there lives on the ancient claim:

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:51.729
we win or lose within ourselves.

00:10:51.753 --> 00:10:54.976
The shining trophies on our shelves
can never win tomorrow's game.

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:58.286
You and I know deeper down, there's
always a chance to win the crown.

00:10:58.310 --> 00:10:59.976
But when we fail to give our best,

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:03.079
we simply haven't met the test,
of giving all and saving none